The [[https://www.dragino.com/products/lora-lorawan-gateway/item/148-lps8.html|Dragino LPS8]] is an open source [[wp>LoRa#LoRaWAN|LoRaWAN]] gateway based on the AR9331 SoC to bridge a LoRa wireless network to an IP network via WiFi or Ethernet. It has one 10/100 Mbps RJ45 Ethernet port, one 2.4 GHz 802.11bgn radio and one USB host port. It is powered via a USB type C connector.

{{:media:dragino:dragino_lps8_front.jpg?300|Dragino LPS8 front view}}

